WEBVTT

00:13.020 --> 00:15.689
[ambient noise]

00:46.053 --> 00:49.139
[people clamoring]

00:50.056 --> 00:51.266
[man 1] Let's go!

00:52.225 --> 00:53.977
[crowd clamoring]

00:58.482 --> 01:00.192
- [man 1] Go, go!
- [man 2] Here we go!

01:00.984 --> 01:02.152
[man 3] What is that?

01:03.361 --> 01:04.529
[crowd grunting and clamoring]

01:05.655 --> 01:07.657
[opening theme song playing]

01:18.794 --> 01:23.131
FOOL NIGHT

02:35.036 --> 02:37.247
TRANSFLORA MEDICAL

02:49.593 --> 02:51.344
[gurney wheels clattering]

03:02.731 --> 03:04.149
[footsteps approaching]

03:18.246 --> 03:22.500
Akira Yatsuka, there was a secret document
borrowed from the Archives

03:22.584 --> 03:26.630
inside of a locker on the 12th-floor
of the Transfloration treatment center.

03:26.713 --> 03:29.049
After examination by several people,

03:29.799 --> 03:33.553
it was determined that this document
is a complete fake

03:34.179 --> 03:37.807
There was also a long strand
of blonde hair found in the locker.

03:38.850 --> 03:40.435
Given the circumstances,

03:40.518 --> 03:42.812
it's safe to assume
this document belongs to you

03:42.896 --> 03:44.314
and that you hid it in the locker

03:44.397 --> 03:47.067
to keep it from those
who were pursuing you.

03:47.150 --> 03:49.319
Can you tell me exactly what this is?

03:49.402 --> 03:52.697
During all the fighting that happened
to retrieve this document,

03:52.781 --> 03:54.699
it seems as though over ten people died.

03:55.867 --> 03:58.036
Why do you even have something like this?

03:58.578 --> 04:01.790
Everything written in it only makes
Transflora Medical look bad.

04:02.374 --> 04:04.084
What is it that you're plotting?

04:05.585 --> 04:08.338
[Akira] I was fighting
the Anti-Transfloration Movement

04:08.421 --> 04:10.590
in order to protect Transfloration.

04:10.674 --> 04:12.592
Those people are the ones.

04:12.676 --> 04:14.344
They're the ones who created Ivy!

04:14.427 --> 04:16.680
And Dr. Kudai has been working with them!

04:16.763 --> 04:17.847
We don't know where he is.

04:17.931 --> 04:20.725
We made that document as bait
to get him to show himself!

04:20.809 --> 04:22.018
Do you have any proof

04:22.102 --> 04:24.938
that the Anti-Transfloration Movement
created Ivy?

04:25.021 --> 04:27.899
Do you have any proof
that Dr. Kudai is alive?

04:27.983 --> 04:29.734
I'm telling you the truth!

04:29.818 --> 04:32.070
We want to protect Transfloration.

04:32.153 --> 04:34.281
Overturn the results of your examination,

04:34.364 --> 04:36.783
tell everyone that
the document isn't a fake!

04:36.866 --> 04:38.910
I have no intention of doing that.

04:38.994 --> 04:42.080
The document is full of baseless
conspiracy theories.

04:42.163 --> 04:46.042
Why would I put my stamp on something
that would make us look bad if it got out?

04:46.126 --> 04:49.254
If you don't then Transflora Medical
is going to be shut down!

04:50.922 --> 04:53.508
If the Transfloration Board
can remain intact ,

04:54.175 --> 04:55.635
then that's all that matters.

04:55.719 --> 04:59.264
We will tear this place down
and build a new one somewhere else.

05:00.056 --> 05:01.933
There will be an internal investigation

05:02.017 --> 05:06.521
into the forgery of a secret document
as well as the multiple bodies we found.

05:06.604 --> 05:09.024
After that,
we'll determine your punishment

05:09.107 --> 05:10.775
and you'll answer for your actions.

05:10.859 --> 05:12.694
[door opens]

05:12.777 --> 05:15.697
[footsteps approaching]

05:18.825 --> 05:21.745
Mr. Tachibana,
regarding today's incident--

05:21.828 --> 05:23.288
[gunshot]

05:23.371 --> 05:24.372
Huh…

05:29.377 --> 05:31.713
Akira, how's it goin'?

05:32.339 --> 05:33.798
Long time no see.

05:33.882 --> 05:36.176
I think that the last time I saw you

05:36.259 --> 05:38.970
was when we went to Common Burger
after school together.

05:40.472 --> 05:41.514
[Akira] Nishi?

05:44.434 --> 05:45.727
[gasps] What's happening?

05:46.811 --> 05:48.271
Why do you have…

05:48.354 --> 05:49.773
You… you just… you murdered…

05:49.856 --> 05:52.442
Why would… What the hell is going on?

05:57.614 --> 05:58.615
The Movement?

05:59.240 --> 06:00.992
[scoffs] Yeah, that's right.

06:01.076 --> 06:02.869
I work for the Movement now.

06:03.828 --> 06:06.372
I wanna destroy
the entire Transfloration system.

06:06.456 --> 06:09.125
But why? Nishi, what for?

06:10.919 --> 06:12.879
Because you people are creating monsters.

06:13.421 --> 06:16.216
You thought it was Transflora Medical?

06:16.299 --> 06:18.885
I swear, we weren't the ones
who created Ivy.

06:18.968 --> 06:21.638
Hikasa and Dr. Kudai worked together
to create him!

06:21.721 --> 06:23.723
Oh, I wasn't talking about Ivy.

06:23.807 --> 06:27.268
I was talking about the countless number
of Spiriflora you've created.

06:27.352 --> 06:28.520
[gasps]

06:29.771 --> 06:31.523
[Nishi] Have you gotten used to it?

06:31.606 --> 06:34.943
The rotting flesh
as Transfloration progresses.

06:35.026 --> 06:38.488
The jumbling of memories,
the breakdown of the self.

06:38.571 --> 06:41.407
Those people should've been able
to die a normal death.

06:41.491 --> 06:44.786
But because of Transfloration,
they die over and over again.

06:46.037 --> 06:50.458
Even now, I can't help but find it
absolutely terrifying and disgusting.

06:50.542 --> 06:52.794
How could you do something so horrible?

06:55.880 --> 06:56.965
When we were kids…

06:59.217 --> 07:01.761
the two of us were always
so frightened by it.

07:02.804 --> 07:06.432
But you went and dyed your hair blonde
and got a management position.

07:06.516 --> 07:08.268
You see people as numbers.

07:08.351 --> 07:10.895
You rationalize death
as part of the system.

07:10.979 --> 07:12.939
Are you not frightened anymore?

07:13.022 --> 07:14.941
Do you think you've become tougher?

07:15.024 --> 07:17.944
You should remind yourself
of what it really means to do it…

07:18.987 --> 07:20.697
to undergo Transfloration.

07:23.324 --> 07:24.826
[Akira breathes shakily]

07:26.327 --> 07:27.328
This document,

07:27.412 --> 07:30.081
it shows that Dr. Kudai
and Transflora Medical

07:30.165 --> 07:34.002
have been jointly developing Ivy
since a long time ago.

07:34.085 --> 07:36.004
But it's just a fake, right?

07:36.087 --> 07:39.340
It was circulated among a group
of inspectors for them to review.

07:40.091 --> 07:42.677
Well, I'll be using it as is.

07:43.720 --> 07:45.847
It'll be good fuel for the protests.

07:45.930 --> 07:47.891
In fact, it'll be more than just fuel--

07:47.974 --> 07:49.434
It will never work.

07:49.517 --> 07:51.895
Transflora Medical
won't be held accountable.

07:51.978 --> 07:53.188
They proved it was a fake.

07:53.271 --> 07:55.732
The Transfloration Board
already proved it!

07:56.399 --> 07:57.525
[scoffs]

07:58.026 --> 08:02.489
Do you think I meant I was gonna bring
this to court like an idiot? [scoffs]

08:03.490 --> 08:05.366
It'll be a rumor I start

08:05.450 --> 08:07.494
that somehow gets leaked around the world.

08:08.161 --> 08:09.746
Everyone will think it's real.

08:10.538 --> 08:13.875
The Archives!
They would deny all of it right away!

08:15.126 --> 08:17.295
Who's ever going
to believe an organization

08:17.378 --> 08:20.381
that's so opaque you can't
see anything from the outside?

08:21.883 --> 08:25.762
People only ever believe
what they want to believe.

08:27.764 --> 08:28.640
[gun cocks]

08:28.723 --> 08:30.099
[gasps]

08:30.558 --> 08:33.436
I'll make Transfloration
disappear for good.

08:34.020 --> 08:35.855
[breathing shakily]

08:38.942 --> 08:41.027
- [gunshot]
- [glass shatters]

08:50.745 --> 08:52.872
[Akira breathing shakily]

08:52.956 --> 08:54.541
[protestors shouting]

09:00.004 --> 09:01.381
[grunting]

09:04.551 --> 09:07.428
- [clamoring]
- [explosions]

09:08.555 --> 09:10.265
[Nishi] I guess I'll get
straight to the point.

09:10.348 --> 09:14.227
There was no connection between
Dr. Kudai and Transflora Medical.

09:15.270 --> 09:18.481
Yes, they were clearly using it as bait.

09:18.565 --> 09:21.234
However, I thought we could
actually use it to our advantage.

09:23.069 --> 09:26.489
It's time for us to make a real difference
in the Transfloration system.

09:29.576 --> 09:33.079
<i>Please go and shine a light</i>
<i>on them all, Mr. Hikasa.</i>

09:37.542 --> 09:40.253
And punish every last one of them
while you're at it.

09:42.839 --> 09:45.008
[straining]

09:46.593 --> 09:48.261
[breathing heavily]

09:51.347 --> 09:52.932
[panting]

09:58.021 --> 09:59.105
Sorry, that I'm late!

09:59.188 --> 10:00.231
Yomiko!

10:00.315 --> 10:01.149
Let's go.

10:01.941 --> 10:03.901
[engine revving]

10:04.444 --> 10:06.321
[panting]

10:08.448 --> 10:12.827
So, you're telling me you didn't actually
steal the secret document,

10:12.910 --> 10:14.287
but you made the whole thing up?

10:16.122 --> 10:18.333
Would the Anti-Transfloration Movement

10:18.416 --> 10:21.085
even want to go through the courts
in the first place?

10:21.169 --> 10:22.920
I mean, if they did that
then they would risk

10:23.004 --> 10:25.882
exposing their own involvement
with Ivy, right?

10:25.965 --> 10:28.009
Wouldn't people like that use the document

10:28.092 --> 10:31.012
to just blame everything
on Transflora Medical?

10:31.095 --> 10:33.681
Mm. That outcome was already
factored into the plan.

10:33.765 --> 10:35.933
Uh, what do you mean?

10:36.017 --> 10:40.605
The truth is that Dr. Kudai
didn't leave any trace of himself.

10:40.688 --> 10:44.817
At first, I thought it was the Movement
who had erased him from every record.

10:44.901 --> 10:46.569
But his name had even been removed

10:46.653 --> 10:49.906
from 40-year-old documents
related to the Transfloration system

10:49.989 --> 10:51.783
and all the research on it.

10:51.866 --> 10:53.910
It's hard to believe
the Anti-Transfloration Movement

10:53.993 --> 10:56.120
erased all traces of him that far back.

10:56.204 --> 11:00.583
The more logical explanation is that
Dr. Kudai removed his name himself.

11:00.667 --> 11:04.253
I don't know why, but for about 40 years

11:04.337 --> 11:07.215
he's gone to great lengths
to erase all trace of himself.

11:07.298 --> 11:09.759
If the Movement
makes that document public,

11:09.842 --> 11:11.844
Dr. Kudai will become known to the world.

11:11.928 --> 11:14.472
Plus, it would be because
of fake information.

11:15.181 --> 11:18.768
If that happens,
the doctor would never stand for it.

11:18.851 --> 11:21.312
I think he would expose
the history of his joint research

11:21.396 --> 11:24.273
with the Anti-Transfloration Movement
as retaliation.

11:24.357 --> 11:25.942
Hikasa knows he would do that,

11:26.025 --> 11:30.238
so in order to prevent it from happening,
he'll find Dr. Kudai and eliminate him.

11:30.321 --> 11:33.491
That's when we'll swoop in
and snatch the doctor.

11:33.574 --> 11:37.286
So that's the other route we might
have to take for this operation.

11:38.788 --> 11:41.165
You have friends on the outside
helping you with this.

11:41.249 --> 11:42.875
Can't you just wait here
while they get it done?

11:43.543 --> 11:47.213
Like I said, it won't work without me!

11:47.922 --> 11:50.591
If the document is stolen
right this minute

11:50.675 --> 11:52.885
and Hikasa goes to kill Dr. Kudai,

11:52.969 --> 11:54.220
who's gonna follow him?

11:54.804 --> 11:56.764
We have a mercenary unit,

11:56.848 --> 11:59.267
but they wouldn't be able
to make sense of any information

11:59.350 --> 12:01.978
they find on the doctor
and the Movement creating Ivy.

12:02.562 --> 12:03.771
[breathing heavily]

12:04.272 --> 12:05.982
I have to be the one to do it.

12:08.526 --> 12:10.278
- [Reiji] Go out through this door.
- [gasps]

12:10.361 --> 12:11.737
I'll pry it open for you.

12:11.821 --> 12:14.866
And I'll show you the way
out through the ducts, alright?

12:14.949 --> 12:16.742
I promise that nobody will see you.

12:16.826 --> 12:19.203
[Sota] How would you know
anything about that?

12:19.287 --> 12:21.497
[Alice] What do you think I'm doing
when I'm slacking off?

12:21.581 --> 12:25.877
[Reiji] Yomiko, you'll stop the negative
rumors about Transflora Medical, right?

12:25.960 --> 12:29.338
For my daughter's sake,
I wanna be proud of the work I do.

12:34.093 --> 12:35.720
[exhales]

12:38.473 --> 12:40.725
Hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry!

12:40.808 --> 12:42.727
Faster, faster, faster,
faster, faster, faster.

12:42.810 --> 12:44.896
Hurry the hell up!
I know you can go faster than this!

12:44.979 --> 12:47.023
Relax!

12:47.106 --> 12:49.484
Being far from the city isn't really safe.

12:49.567 --> 12:51.152
Are you sure that there's enough oxygen?

12:51.235 --> 12:53.279
We'll have oxygen. It's fine.

12:53.362 --> 12:56.491
Yomiko planned for that.
She had me get these masks for us.

12:56.574 --> 12:58.618
[man] Hey, Graham, where are you now?

12:58.701 --> 13:01.078
I'm at the fourth block of Shichi Street.

13:01.162 --> 13:03.748
All of the buildings here look abandoned.

13:03.831 --> 13:07.210
I think they noticed me, but they don't
seem to be changing course.

13:08.920 --> 13:10.421
[Yomiko] Where is it?

13:10.505 --> 13:11.923
Where is Hikasa going?

13:12.006 --> 13:14.842
Where's the lab? Where is Dr. Kudai?

13:15.635 --> 13:19.555
[Graham] <i>I can't get through to Takami</i>
<i>or the others at Transflora Medical.</i>

13:19.639 --> 13:21.015
<i>You heard anything from them?</i>

13:21.098 --> 13:22.391
[man] No, not a thing.

13:22.475 --> 13:24.018
<i>Uh, they were probably taken out.</i>

13:24.101 --> 13:24.977
[Yomiko and Toshiro gasp]

13:30.566 --> 13:32.610
[sighs in exasperation]

13:35.446 --> 13:37.740
[Yomiko] <i>The agent we interrogated</i>
<i>had met the doctor,</i>

13:37.823 --> 13:41.285
<i>but it seemed like he didn't know</i>
<i>where that meeting took place.</i>

13:42.203 --> 13:43.871
<i>And the place they're heading to now</i>

13:43.955 --> 13:46.666
<i>is one of the areas that didn't</i>
<i>get a reaction out of him</i>

13:46.749 --> 13:48.251
<i>when we showed him on the map.</i>

13:49.085 --> 13:51.170
<i>He didn't know where the place was.</i>

13:58.469 --> 13:59.637
[gasps]

13:59.720 --> 14:02.640
<i>Could it be that the lab is mobile?</i>

14:03.266 --> 14:07.520
<i>A place that's constantly moving,</i>
<i>but where a lab could continue to operate.</i>

14:12.024 --> 14:13.192
[breathing heavily]

14:18.114 --> 14:19.198
The subway!

14:19.282 --> 14:20.116
- Huh?
- Huh?

14:20.199 --> 14:23.786
There are abandoned rail lines that run
all across the outskirts of the city.

14:23.869 --> 14:25.872
[Graham] <i>Hikasa and the others</i>
<i>went underground.</i>

14:25.955 --> 14:27.248
- [Toshiro] Hmm.
- That means I'm right!

14:27.331 --> 14:32.003
<i>Dr. Kudai has converted a train</i>
<i>into a lab and is running it in circles.</i>

14:35.298 --> 14:36.841
Seriously? That's insane!

14:36.924 --> 14:38.175
Hurry!

14:38.259 --> 14:41.304
The closest entrance
to the subway tunnels is two blocks ahead.

14:41.387 --> 14:42.221
There, on the right!

14:58.321 --> 15:01.449
[man] That monster is on the train
with him, right?

15:01.532 --> 15:04.327
Yes, because Dr. Kudai
is treating him right now.

15:05.119 --> 15:06.662
So, will it be safe for us?

15:06.996 --> 15:08.623
When we took him last time,

15:08.706 --> 15:10.207
Kawada got seriously injured

15:10.291 --> 15:13.169
because Mukuru Izumi was highly agitated.

15:13.252 --> 15:16.172
But he's inside a hibernation capsule now.

15:16.255 --> 15:17.340
We'll be okay.

15:19.008 --> 15:21.469
Kawada will never walk again.

15:22.386 --> 15:24.847
Do not touch Mukuru Izumi.

15:24.931 --> 15:26.974
I only want you to kill Dr. Kudai, got it?

15:30.770 --> 15:33.147
[wheels squeaking]

15:33.230 --> 15:37.193
That monster is needed as the symbol
of the evil of Transfloration.

15:39.987 --> 15:42.239
The doctor will be in the first car.

15:42.323 --> 15:43.407
[gunshot]

15:47.578 --> 15:48.704
[grunts]

15:51.749 --> 15:53.042
- [gunshot]
- [glass shatters]

15:53.125 --> 15:54.126
[grunting]

15:55.044 --> 15:56.462
Stop!

15:56.545 --> 15:58.089
[groaning]

15:59.882 --> 16:03.844
Yomiko Horai, I want to know how
you found out about Dr. Kudai.

16:03.928 --> 16:05.471
Wait, how do you…

16:05.554 --> 16:06.847
How do you know my name?

16:06.931 --> 16:08.307
I gave a list to him,

16:08.849 --> 16:12.812
the person in Late Stage Transfloration
that you people call Ivy.

16:12.895 --> 16:14.188
That was how I got him to act.

16:14.271 --> 16:15.106
[Yomiko] A list?

16:15.773 --> 16:19.568
A list of people I figured
Ivy would want to get revenge on.

16:19.652 --> 16:22.989
The person that I put
at the very top of that list was you.

16:23.072 --> 16:23.990
[gasps]

16:25.574 --> 16:29.704
You're the one who is responsible
for all of this turmoil, Yomiko Horai.

16:30.371 --> 16:32.748
This whole tragedy started
when you made Ivy's sister,

16:32.832 --> 16:36.335
Shiika Izumi, undergo Transfloration.

16:38.587 --> 16:41.382
You're the one who's made
Ivy do everything he's done.

16:41.465 --> 16:42.550
I'm not the…

16:43.092 --> 16:44.885
I'm not the only one at fault here.

16:44.969 --> 16:47.888
You're the one who's had the power
to make the final decision.

16:47.972 --> 16:50.725
The sinister economic system
of Paupertown,

16:50.808 --> 16:54.186
the open secret of sacrificing people
to Transfloration,

16:54.270 --> 16:56.981
it's all up to the discretion
of the lower-level employees.

16:57.606 --> 17:00.109
But it was forced upon you, wasn't it?

17:00.192 --> 17:01.610
You don't understand, though.

17:02.069 --> 17:04.947
The higher-ups had told us that
it was something we all had to do

17:05.031 --> 17:06.532
to save the residents of Paupertown.

17:07.366 --> 17:12.163
I saved 100 people by making
just one person undergo Transfloration.

17:12.246 --> 17:15.458
A lot of other people were heavily taxed
for that Subsidy, though.

17:15.541 --> 17:17.668
You might have saved 100 people,

17:17.752 --> 17:20.921
but countless others
lost their homes and families.

17:22.465 --> 17:24.175
Don't you think that's wrong?

17:24.258 --> 17:27.136
Don't you think it would be better
if this system didn't exist?

17:27.219 --> 17:29.513
We wouldn't have enough oxygen without it.

17:29.597 --> 17:31.432
If we want humanity to survive, then--

17:31.515 --> 17:34.268
"We must sacrifice the few
in order to save the many."

17:34.351 --> 17:36.604
Can you honestly say
that you wouldn't be complaining

17:36.687 --> 17:38.397
about the Transfloration system

17:38.481 --> 17:41.567
if it were your family and friends
who were among the few?

17:41.650 --> 17:42.651
What about you?

17:42.735 --> 17:45.654
You made Ivy and had him
kill people all for your cause.

17:45.738 --> 17:48.115
You've been killing people
just to get your opinion across.

17:48.199 --> 17:49.658
Sacrifices are an inevitable part of--

17:49.742 --> 17:51.827
I've had enough of all your bullshit!

17:51.911 --> 17:54.538
You're completely contradicting yourself!

17:54.622 --> 17:58.334
Everything I've done was a decision
I made with conviction.

17:58.417 --> 18:00.419
I believe justice and love will prevail.

18:01.295 --> 18:03.839
And I believe that they are on my side.

18:03.923 --> 18:08.177
Yomiko Horai, whenever you perform
Transfloration on people,

18:08.260 --> 18:10.596
do you truly believe
that what you're doing

18:10.679 --> 18:13.099
is leading humanity
into a brighter future?

18:16.018 --> 18:18.437
Do you feel that justice is on your side?

18:19.647 --> 18:23.359
I assure you there isn't
an ounce of deception in my actions.

18:24.110 --> 18:25.861
Under this dark sky,

18:25.945 --> 18:29.073
I aim to keep as much misfortune
at bay as I can.

18:29.156 --> 18:30.908
[melancholy music playing]

18:43.838 --> 18:45.714
Only once that has come to pass

18:45.798 --> 18:49.093
will we finally be able to forge
our own path to happiness.

18:51.345 --> 18:52.346
No.

18:53.389 --> 18:55.808
Who cares about that? About justice.

18:55.891 --> 18:58.686
I… I just want to be happy.

18:58.769 --> 19:00.688
I want my heart to be full.

19:00.771 --> 19:01.981
That's what I'm fighting for!

19:02.064 --> 19:03.941
Don't sit there
and try to reduce all of this

19:04.024 --> 19:06.569
to something as trivial
as a personal matter.

19:06.652 --> 19:08.946
Think of how society benefits us.

19:09.029 --> 19:13.284
Water, electricity,
agriculture, infrastructure.

19:13.909 --> 19:16.287
Since we received
all of those things from society,

19:16.370 --> 19:18.080
we now have a responsibility.

19:18.164 --> 19:21.041
A responsibility
to think about its future.

19:21.917 --> 19:25.087
None of that matters, because
I'll be dead in less than two years.

19:25.171 --> 19:26.589
I don't have a future!

19:26.672 --> 19:28.382
I do sympathize with you,

19:28.465 --> 19:30.342
but just because
your life won't last long,

19:30.426 --> 19:32.511
that's no reason
not to think of the future.

19:33.095 --> 19:35.556
If you lack conviction,
then you should get off this train.

19:35.639 --> 19:37.308
I'm going on ahead.

19:38.267 --> 19:40.311
Yomiko! Hikasa's gonna leave!

19:40.394 --> 19:41.353
We have to stop him!

19:41.979 --> 19:43.731
Yomiko! Get ahold of yourself!

19:43.814 --> 19:46.150
Hey, Hikasa! You're done!

19:46.233 --> 19:47.067
[gasps, grunts]

19:47.151 --> 19:48.569
[man grunts]

19:48.652 --> 19:51.488
Please, sir you have to go.
I'll make sure-- [grunts]

19:53.532 --> 19:54.700
[grunting, panting]

19:57.620 --> 19:59.079
Damn it!

19:59.163 --> 20:00.456
We've come so far.

20:01.874 --> 20:03.250
We have to stop him.

20:03.626 --> 20:05.085
Toshiro, I…

20:05.169 --> 20:07.922
Yomiko! The rest of the train's
getting away from us.

20:08.005 --> 20:10.174
Find something we can use
to get over there!

20:11.842 --> 20:12.676
All right.

20:15.763 --> 20:18.432
Why the hell are there so many
damn beakers in here?

20:18.515 --> 20:19.808
[glass clinking]

20:23.187 --> 20:24.230
[sobbing softly]

20:31.737 --> 20:32.571
I'm sorry…

20:33.489 --> 20:35.199
[Yomiko continues sobbing]

20:35.282 --> 20:36.867
I just realized…

20:37.243 --> 20:38.369
I'm sorry.

20:38.452 --> 20:41.580
I know I… I should have shot him,
but I just…

20:42.164 --> 20:44.708
What… What am I doing? I… [sobbing]

20:44.792 --> 20:45.668
[inaudible]

20:50.256 --> 20:54.718
Everything that we've done so far…
it's all ruined because of me.

20:57.304 --> 21:02.226
I said that I was going to protect you,
Toshiro, but then…

21:07.564 --> 21:08.565
[Yomiko sniffling]

21:12.027 --> 21:14.488
It's fine, it'll still work out.

21:16.073 --> 21:18.033
There could be proof in here.

21:18.117 --> 21:20.119
Proof that
the Anti-Transfloration Movement

21:20.202 --> 21:21.745
and Dr. Kudai worked together.

21:22.538 --> 21:23.539
Let's look for it.

21:24.581 --> 21:25.833
[Yomiko exhales shakily]

21:26.333 --> 21:28.252
[Spiriflor voices overlapping]
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:28.335 --> 21:29.461
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:29.545 --> 21:30.754
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:30.838 --> 21:32.131
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:32.214 --> 21:33.507
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:33.590 --> 21:34.758
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:34.842 --> 21:36.719
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

21:36.802 --> 21:38.721
Yomiko, get up! Yomiko!

21:39.847 --> 21:41.140
[both grunting]

21:43.851 --> 21:44.852
[Yomiko screaming]

21:50.149 --> 21:51.317
[gasping]

22:04.496 --> 22:09.293
Ivy. Mukuru Izumi. Can you hear me?

22:11.128 --> 22:12.504
[Ivy] <i>The white-haired man.</i>

22:13.047 --> 22:14.631
<i>Get out of the way!</i>

22:14.715 --> 22:16.300
<i>I need to kill that person.</i>

22:17.092 --> 22:20.137
She's too important to me.
I won't let you!

22:22.431 --> 22:24.433
[closing theme music playing]
